prompt:
Use Three.js to implement a bottle flip challenge game. Load WaterBottle.glb, allow the player to drag and launch the bottle, and determine whether it lands upright.

[Three.js Import Method (Must Be Followed Strictly)]
Use the following importmap in the <head>, and import through ES Modules in <script type="module">:
<script type="importmap">
{ "imports": {
    "three": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.170.0/build/three.module.js",
    "three/addons/": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.170.0/examples/jsm/"
} }
</script>
<script type="module">
import * as THREE from 'three';
import { GLTFLoader } from 'three/addons/loaders/GLTFLoader.js';
import { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';
// Write your code here
</script>

[Model Loading]
(1) Use GLTFLoader to load assets/WaterBottle.glb;
(2) Initially place the bottle upright on the tabletop (y=0);

[Tabletop]
(3) A gray tabletop plane (10x10), y=0;

[Launch Interaction]
(4) Press the mouse button over the bottle and drag upward;
(5) On release, calculate the launch force (vector) based on the drag direction and distance;
(6) While dragging, display a dashed line indicating the direction and force magnitude;

[Physics Simulation]
(7) Gravity g = 9.8 m/s² (downward);
(8) The bottle undergoes both translation and rotation while airborne;
(9) Angular velocity is determined by the horizontal component of the launch force;

[Landing Determination]
(10) Determine that the bottle has landed when the bottle's bottom y <= 0;
(11) Upon landing, if the bottle's rotational angle deviates from vertical by < 15 degrees, the upright landing is successful (+1 point, green flash);
(12) Otherwise, it is a failure (red flash);
(13) Automatically reset the bottle to its initial position 2 seconds after landing;

[HUD Display]
(14) HUD in the upper-left corner:
  - Score (id="score")
  - Throw count (id="throwCount")
  - Last landing angle (id="lastAngle")
  - Best consecutive success count (id="bestStreak")

[State Exposure (Required)]
Update window.__3D_STATE__ every frame:
  - modelLoaded: boolean
  - score: number
  - throwCount: number
  - lastAngle: number (degrees)
  - bestStreak: number
  - bottlePos: {x, y, z}
  - bottleRotation: {x, y, z} (Euler angles)
  - isFlying: boolean

Output a single standalone HTML file.
